            "review_text": "Scott\nSydney, Australia932 contributions\n0\nGreat buffet lunch with a lot of vairety\nMar 2017 • Business\nWe ate here with a large group and all enjoyed our varied selections from the buffet.\n\nGreat local food choices with a mix of some western options.\n\nDon't miss the prawn meat cook on sugar cane sticks.\n\nNice cold beer and you can't beat the local Saigon Special. \n\nRestaurant looks over the road to the Saigon River. \n\nI look forward to returning.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten March 8, 2017",
